 EE INTRO to CX Skills at 9am on each race day for a preview of the course 
 and introduction to cyclocross-specific skills and strategy. Access to Rid
 e Rock Creek is for the event only. Additional downhill riding at Ride Roc
 k Creek is available with purchase of a pass from the venue. All races are
