BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pisgah 111 / 555
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTSTAMP:20260925T143842Z
UID:c6d05d9f51734aa6@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The Pisgah 111 is the quintessential crusher of a cross-countr
 y endurance MTB race. Racers follow a 65.1 mile course with 10\,200' feet 
 of climbing along the most iconic trails and gravel roads known in Pisgah 
 National Forest. Just peek at the course map and list of trails and you’
 ll immediately get chills just thinking about the epic scenery and terrain
  you’ll encounter. There will be FOUR rest areas (at three locations) fo
 r the Pisgah 111 that will be stocked with water\, food (PB&J\, fruit\, sa
 lty snacks\, sweet snacks\, bars)\, first aid\, and neutral mechanical sup
 port. Riders may send drop bags to each rest area. Be sure to read the inf
 ormation below\, too. The Pisgah 555 will test the strength and endurance 
 of racers by challenging them to complete a 39.7 mile course with 7325' of
  climbing a\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/2026-pisgah-111-555\n\nSource:
  BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.2811489;-82.7229988
LOCATION:1 Davidson River Cir\, Pisgah Forest\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/2026-pisgah-111-555
END:VEVENT
