CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The Middle Fork Fondo 2026 benefits Bikes 4 Kids NC\, supporti
 ng the year-round work that makes it possible to provide bicycles to child
 ren in need at Christmas. There are four scenic routes with minimal elevat
 ion to choose from at distances of 62\, 50\, 35\, 21 miles. An aid station
  will be available for hydration and snacks. There will be 3 optional time
 d sectors for those that want to test their fitness and win the bragging r
 ights for this years event! Must have Strava if you want your time recorde
 d. 9am start time. Beer ticket included with registration for those 21+ **
 *Download your route from the links below *** The roads will not be marked
 . 64 miler https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53353523 50 miler https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/53353522 35 miler https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53353520
  2\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/the-middle-fork-fondo-2026\n\nSource: B
 ikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.3804629;-82.5654982
LOCATION:336 Banner Farm Rd\, Mills River\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/the-middle-fork-fondo-2026
