BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1000 Mile BikeWalk for Prevention
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20260925T143842Z
UID:ca69c113117cd0e8@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The 1000 Mile BikeWalk for Prevention to be held October 31\, 
 2026\, Halloween morning. THIS IS A NEW DATE. The " Spooktacular " 1000 Mi
 ler is a regional fun ride/walk/run for kids\, teens\, adults... the whole
  family... to enjoy a fun and healthy morning while helping a good cause. 
 Not a timed race\, the 1000 Miler will record the travel distance reported
  by every runner and rider to reach the cumulative event goal of 1000 mile
 s. It's Halloween! Costumes and bike decorations are highly encouraged. Te
 ams\, too. Family-friendly pricing applies. Long and short biking and walk
 ing circuits of 5 miles and 1 mile\, respectively\, over semi-closed roadw
 ays\, plus a 1/2 mile sidewalk-only Jr. BikeWaker route for kids. grandpar
 ents\, etc. Multiple laps are encouraged to build mileage and allow specta
 tors to \n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Morristown/1000MileBikeWal
 kForPrevention\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bi
 ke/calendar
LOCATION:4355 Durham Landing Morristown\, Morristown\, TN
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Morristown/1000MileBikeWalkForPrevention
END:VEVENT
