BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Shred Rock Creek
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTSTAMP:20260925T143842Z
UID:0a67e54dee113b1a@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:We Shred Rock Creek is back for 2026 – and it is shaping up 
 to be one heck of a good time on bikes. Whether you’re looking to progre
 ss\, try a new trail\, ride Rock Creek (or any bike park!) for the first t
 ime\, or just meet other rad women+ and girls who ride\, this event is for
  you! Women+ and Girls Take Over Rock Creek! No matter your skill level\, 
 showing up and riding any mountain bike park can be a little intimidating
 \, especially if you don't have a friend to ride with. That’s why we’r
 e extending an invite out to women+ of all ages to join us at Rock Creek 
 – without racing or egos – to have fun on the trails and progress at y
 our own pace. Join pro downhill racer/ MTB skills coach/ mom Caroline Wash
 am for a chill day of doing what we all love: riding bikes\, talking about
  bikes\, and relaxin\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/we-shred-rock-creek\n
 \nSource: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.1997867;-82.5085187
LOCATION:298 W Rock Creek Rd\, Zirconia\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/we-shred-rock-creek
END:VEVENT
