BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pisgah DOUBLE DARE
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTSTAMP:20260925T143842Z
UID:59bf1e39a66ae34b@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Every year an event comes along that tests mental and physical
  strengths of its racers like no other. Pisgah Productions proudly present
 s the hardest (and most fun) thing you will do this year….. the DOUBLE D
 ARE. Teams of two riders will race to reach up to 10 checkpoints (CPs) per
  day\, two days in a row. The race begins at 10AM on Saturday and every te
 am must be back before 10PM. The race resumes at 6AM Sunday with 10 brand 
 new checkpoints. Every team must finish before 6PM on Sunday. Teams ‘in 
 the running’ should expect up to 70 miles of riding with 12\,000-15\,000
  feet of climbing each day. SINGLE-DARE! The one-day category at Double-Da
 re!!! Teams of two riders will race up to 10 checkpoints\, in any order\, 
 and return to the start/finish the fastest. Checkpoint locations will rema
 in secret\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-double-dare-2026\n\nSourc
 e: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.2844925407938;-82.8203944998303
LOCATION:1 Davidson River Circle\, Brevard\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-double-dare-2026
END:VEVENT
