DESCRIPTION:Review the event website here. The 2026 guide will be posted c
 loser to the event date. Pre-registration for collegiate\, category\, mast
 er's\, and elite racers is open online until Thursday\, November 19\, 2026
 \, at 11:59 p.m. ET. UCI categories must pre-register. Day-of registration
  is available online for non-UCI races and closes 60 minutes before the st
 art of each designated race. There is an additional $15 fee for the day of
  registration. All racers must collect a new bib number for the NCGP. Timi
 ng chips will remain the same for NCCX series racers. Staging and call-ups
  begin 15 minutes before each race start. Be prompt\, as our UCI officials
  will be staging racers and strictly staying on schedule. The early bell a
 nd/or 80% rule will be in effect\, so pay attention to your elapsed race t
