DESCRIPTION:Runs 1 Dec 2026 to 30 May 2027. Regular season with practices 
 and races. January includes 2-4 indoor training opportunities. February ha
 s 1 weekend practice per week. March-May has 2 rides per week (1-2 weeknig
 hts after 5pm for 1.5 hours and weekend practices alternating Saturdays/Su
 ndays for 2 hours). Races begin in early March with typically 5-6 races ac
 ross North Carolina through end of May.\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahrage.co
 m/\n\nSource: Pisgah Rage (NICA composite team)\n\nListed by Altar Cycles 
 — altar.bike/calendar
