BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pisgah Stage Race
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270410
DTSTAMP:20260925T143842Z
UID:b96fc2f355480948@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:Pisgah Stage Race is now running as a Three-Day Race. It's not
  goodbye to the Five-Day Version\, but hopefully just we'll see you later.
  RACE FEES CLICK HERE to see the full pay scale on our website. REFUND\, D
 EFERRAL\, and TRANSFER POLICY No transfers or deferrals under ANY circumst
 ances. Refunds available until December 31\, 2026\, at 80% of entry fee. R
 efunds available until January 31\, 2027\, at 50% of entry fee. No refunds
