 rpment of the Blue Ridge Mountains. With dizzying vertical descents to qua
 d-crushing climbs\, you will ride a roller coaster that puts this region o
 n the map for the downhill minded. The venue is an actual Summer Camp. The
 re’s a lake\, pump track\, post-race cookout\, and more! Choose bunkhous
 e or car/tent camping and spend the weekend racing and enjoying life! The 
 course starts in the shadow of the highest peak East of the Mississippi \,
  Mount Mitchell\, on the legendary Heartbreak Ridge trail. Stage one and t
 wo drop over 3000' elevation in a combined 4.5 miles. Stage three follows 
 with the most amazing trail that parallels Interstate 40… Kitsuma\, and 
 descends an\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-enduro-2027\n\nSource: 
 BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
